{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-1851",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "这位前斋宫昔年初赴伊势修行之时，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When this former Ise priestess first went to Ise years ago for her service,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "源氏公子早已留情，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji had already taken an interest in her,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "认为这如花如玉之人，长年修行岂不可惜！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "thinking what a pity it was for someone so lovely to spend long years in religious service.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "现在她已返京，而且失却了慈母，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Now she had returned to the capital and had also lost her loving mother,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "正可设法向她求爱了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so it seemed a good time to find some way to court her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "然而此念一萌，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet as soon as this thought arose,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "照例立刻回心转意，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "as usual he immediately changed his mind,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "觉得这是对人不起的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "feeling that it would be unfair to others.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "他想：“六条妃子临终前担心我与前斋宫今后的关系而谆谆告诫，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He thought, The Rokujo lady warned me earnestly on her deathbed because she worried about my future relationship with the former priestess,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "确是有道理的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and she was certainly right to do so.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "世人一定猜量我爱上了这女孩，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "People will surely suspect that I have fallen in love with this young woman,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "我倒偏偏相反，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but I will do exactly the opposite,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "要清清白白地照顾她。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and look after her in complete purity and honor.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "且待今上年事稍长，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will wait until the present Emperor is a little older,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "略解人事之时，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and has some understanding of human affairs,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "我便送她进后宫去当女御。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then I will send her into the palace to become a consort.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "我膝下子女不多，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I do not have many children of my own,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "生涯常感寂寥，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and throughout my life I have often felt lonely,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "就把她当作养女抚育，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so I could raise her as an adopted daughter,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "岂不甚好！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and would that not be a very good thing?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "如此决心之后，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After making this decision,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 22,
      "source_text": "他便真心诚意地照顾这前斋宫。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he cared for the former priestess with genuine sincerity.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 23,
      "source_text": "有机会就亲赴六条宫邸省视。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Whenever he had the chance, he personally went to the Rokujo residence to visit her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 24,
      "source_text": "并且常对她说：“恕我老实不客气了：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He often said to her, Forgive me for speaking so frankly and without reserve:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 25,
      "source_text": "你应该把我当作父母看待，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "you should regard me as you would a parent,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 26,
      "source_text": "万事毫无顾忌地同我商量，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and consult me about everything without the slightest hesitation,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 27,
      "source_text": "这才符合我的本意。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "for that alone would accord with my true wish.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 28,
      "source_text": "然而这前斋宫生性异常腼腆，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But the former priestess was by nature extremely shy,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 29,
      "source_text": "万事退缩不前，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and shrank back from everything,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 30,
      "source_text": "因此不敢回答。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so she did not dare to answer.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 31,
      "source_text": "自己的声音略微被源氏公子听到一点，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If Prince Genji heard even the slightest sound of her voice,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 32,
      "source_text": "便认为稀世怪事。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "she would regard it as an extraordinary and almost unheard-of event.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 33,
      "source_text": "众侍女多方劝她作答，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her many gentlewomen tried in every way to urge her to reply,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 34,
      "source_text": "总归无效，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but in the end it had no effect,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01851",
      "unit_index": 35,
      "source_text": "大家为她这习性十分担心。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and everyone was deeply worried about this habit of hers.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
